p08 : US Blanks 6'10"A (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 76.9 L)
p97 : This is the 6’9”A mold design again…same everything! This blank can be ordered wider or narrower as to allow for stronger decks/rails near the perimeter of the board outline, and less waste. ALSO AVAILABLE IN
